<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;">National College Decision Day is right around the corner. Have you decided where you will be attending this fall? If you are still considering Arizona State University, we encourage you to pay the enrollment deposit by May 1 to begin your housing and orientation selection. This is easily done on <a href="http://my.asu.edu">My ASU</a> under <b>Important Next Steps</b> in the <b>Priority Task</b> box.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Your financial aid package should be available on the <b>Finances </b>tab. If you have questions regarding tuition, I find the websites below useful for determining if ASU is the right financial fit, along with being the right academic fit.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://students.asu.edu/tuition">Tuition Estimator</a></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://housing.asu.edu/">Housing Costs</a></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://students.asu.edu/financialaid/budget">Student Budget Worksheet</a></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">If you haven’t quite made your decision yet, please let me know if I can be of assistance. I am happy to answer any questions you may have about ASU!</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">If you have chosen a different institution and are no longer considering ASU as an option, also let me know so I can provide instructions on how to cancel your admission.</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">We hope to welcome you to our Sun Devil family!</div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>